<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-normal text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-3">What Are Cookies?</h2>

<p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Cookies are small text files stored on your device that help websites function properly and improve user experience.</p>

<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-normal text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-3">How We Use Cookies</h2>

<p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Cookies may be used to:</p>

<ul class="list-disc list-outside pl-5 space-y-2 text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
  <li>Maintain website functionality</li>
  <li>Remember user preferences</li>
  <li>Improve website performance</li>
  <li>Analyze website traffic</li>
</ul>

<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-normal text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-3">Third-Party Cookies</h2>

<p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Some third-party services embedded within the website may also set cookies according to their own policies.</p>

<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-normal text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-3">Managing Cookies</h2>

<p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Most browsers allow you to control, block, or delete cookies through browser settings. Disabling cookies may affect certain website functionality.</p>

<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-normal text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-3">Changes to This Policy</h2>

<p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">This Cookie Policy may be updated periodically. Any updates will be posted on this page.</p>

<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-normal text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-3">Contact</h2>

<p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">If you have questions regarding our Cookie Policy, please contact us through our Contact page.</p>

